WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.980
Mama! Where are we going, Mama?

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:04.630
I don't know... Where shall we go?

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:11.360
The sunset was so beautiful... it made me forget where we were going.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:15.170
Where would you like to go, Rei?

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:19.130
Anywhere! I'll go anywhere you want, Mama!

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.900
Mama!!

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:30.510
Rei, it will be up to you to protect your sister.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.080
My sister...?

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.280
Yes. Your real sister.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.810
You, at least, can be with me now,

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:43.830
...but your sister cannot.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.770
How come? Why not?

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.710
She was adopted...

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.590
She was taken away from me.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:53.410
Mother!!!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:02.610
Mother...

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:09.480
<b>33. Take Flight</b>

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.500
Dear Brother...

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:18.890
At last, in our campaign to abolish the Sorority,

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.170
...we have signatures of two-thirds of the school.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:25.930
We have presented the petition to the school board.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.610
Now it is Saturday morning.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.580
Nanako-san! Tomoko-san! It's out, finally!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:37.550
What? What's out?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.100
The response! From the school board!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.250
It's posted on the bulletin board!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.450
Really?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.150
Let's see... what does it say... hmmm...

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.500
"With regard to the matter of the abolition of the Sorority,

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.730
...the school board has scheduled an emergency session in one week."

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.550
...signed, "Seiran School Board."

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.860
All right!

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.550
We did it!

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.520
Dear Brother,

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.990
...the petition has finally forced the school officials to act.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.360
The Sorority... it's been involved in so much that has happened...

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.420
I can't deny having mixed feelings regarding the Sorority,

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:25.120
...but at least this will put the matter to rest.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.090
Well, you seem happy.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:05.730
You too.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:11.810
Is it all over now? I wonder...

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.120
All over?

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:18.050
Am I of no use to HER anymore? I wonder...

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:24.420
I know that even if the Sorority is abolished completely,

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.520
...she would carry on exactly as she is now.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.340
Now and forever.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.560
You saw her, didn't you?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.420
Her dignified persona...

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.600
...amidst her unraveling beauty.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:40.190
Pride cannot be attained unless it is longed for.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:44.020
Therefore I will continue to long for it always...

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.270
...regardless of what may happen.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.050
It made me so happy.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.190
I trembled with joy.

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:57.970
Here was the proud Fukiko-sama I knew when I was young.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:00.670
She was herself again.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:07.470
In all the issues concerning the Sorority and the petition,

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.590
...the beauty of Fukiko-sama outshone everything else.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:13.680
This is the happiness I have now.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.110
This strange happiness feels new to me.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.500
I wonder how long it can last.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.040
It's been a while since I had such a good night's sleep.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.820
Is that so? Good for you, Rei.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.870
You're too slow, Tomoko!

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:49.000
Nonsense! You just watch!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:54.110
First place!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.780
Darn, second place...

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:57.810
Owww!

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:01.480
Gee...

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:03.320
There might be no one home.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.240
If only we'd called first...

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.330
Ok then. now let's race to the station.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.980
What, again?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.720
Of course. This time I'll win!

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.110
Yahoo!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.440
Hello!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.640
Please come in.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.920
Takashi-san has been driving us around in his car.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.870
We were visiting real estate agencies.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.430
Real estate agencies?

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:35.490
Yes, Mother and I are looking for a house.

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:36.910
We'll need one, right?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:37.770
Oh!

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.630
No need for a large one -- just a house for Mother and I to live happily.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.550
My Brother... it was the first I'd heard of her moving.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.280
The divorce is final now.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.290
Please come inside. I'm serving Assam tea.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.800
Assam tea? That'll be great!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.650
Oh, were you still here?

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:03.230
Oh... uh... was there any for me...?

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:07.200
No. But I'll make some especially for you.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.000
Normally, male guests aren't invited into the house.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:11.880
Thank you.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.570
I do hope this is to your liking, Ichinomiya-san...

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.650
Wow, creme brule?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.380
I'm actually quite fond of sweets.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.270
Are you really?

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.700
Yes, yes, of course! This is quite an occasion!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.000
No more of your nonsense.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:32.620
Sit down.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.530
OK! Yes Ma'am!

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:40.660
They're trying so hard.

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:45.050
Mariko-san and her mother are trying to be happy.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:48.830
If there were anything at all I could do, I wanted to help.

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.910
Help for Mariko-san in her new life...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.640
Ichinomiya-san was probably trying to help her too.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.490
Father? Fukiko-sama...?

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.250
There is a telephone call for you. From London.

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:17.240
Goodness! From Father!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.300
Hello? Yes, everyone is very well.

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:27.490
Father, you were telling me about that last time you called.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.450
Really? Is that so?

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:34.250
Oh -- my brother has returned now also.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:35.480
Shall I put him on?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.440
He says he'd rather not also.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.610
Oh father, really!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.430
I'm fine.

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:48.100
No need to be concerned about the Sorority events.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.420
Yes, yes, that's right.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.940
I'm more like you than I'm willing to admit, perhaps.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.850
Rei? You asked about Rei?

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.640
She's her usual self.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:03.800
Actually, she seems to be happier these days.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.380
Yes... yes.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.250
Take care of yourself too, Father.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:14.290
That's unusual... Father asking about Rei.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.840
He's always concerned about her.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:21.720
When we talk on the telephone, he always asks about her.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.970
Is that so.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:28.210
Is that so.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:51.260
I'm sorry for asking you to meet me so late...

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.480
Not at all.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:56.240
I suddenly wanted to see you.

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.180
Oh...!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.840
I wanted to thank you.

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:02.210
Thank me? For what I did...?

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:06.130
Maybe... but no, not about that, perhaps...

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.540
Anyhow, I wanted to talk to you.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.070
To someone like you... pure... warm...

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:14.790
...sensitive, but strong as well...

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:19.280
So very pretty too... I wanted to talk to you.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.210
You're acting strange... Very strange!

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.090
Really? Do I sound strange?

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:31.320
Yes... saying those things... about me...

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.900
But suddenly it feels right.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.290
I'm being completely sincere.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:37.930
Look!

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:41.490
See, the skyline is lovely, isn't it?

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:42.340
Yes!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.340
Then everything's OK, right?

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.780
Yes... yes!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.570
The lights are very beautiful.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.130
She doesn't know...

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.290
What?

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.900
She... Fukiko-sama... she is not my step sister.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:07.480
She's my true sister!

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:13.110
She joined the family by adoption right after she was born.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:15.310
She is my full sister.

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:19.080
Just before Mother passed away, she told me the truth,

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.410
...and asked me to take care of her, to protect her.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:28.230
...and to never tell Fukiko-sama the truth.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:33.390
My mother wanted Fukiko-sama to be happy, and part of the Ichinomiya family.

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:38.980
Mother left the world as just a lonely lover, unable to marry,

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.260
...and with that one final wish.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:49.810
Living with my mother gave me such happiness.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:57.290
So it is up to me to protect Fukiko-sama.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:02.350
To protect her pride. My life depends on it.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.830
But why?

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:15.510
Why confide in me? These are such important facts...

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.420
To give them to me... to me...?

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.760
I like you.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.970
Isn't that reason enough?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.600
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:39.090
Now... my heart has found great strength for living.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.430
Saint-Juste-sama....

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:47.120
Oh yes... I'd like to show you the sunset tomorrow.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.290
The sunset?

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:53.390
Yes. I know of a place where you can see the most beautiful sunset.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:58.220
My mother often took me there when I was young.

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:00.670
Where? Where is it?

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:05.300
It's a secret. Shall we go there tomorrow?

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:08.800
Yes... Yes! I would love to go!

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.400
Rather far to go, but...

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:27.980
Dear Brother... the day was very hot.

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:32.470
There were no clouds in the sky, the sun was shining brightly.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.510
I'm going now!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.930
By six in the morning I was already awake.

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.290
I was to meet Saint-Juste-sama at three that afternoon,

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.600
...and I couldn't simply sit around waiting,

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.860
...so I left the house at about a quarter after eleven.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.280
That's good.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.160
Now see here...!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.810
I know. Don't be upset.

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:22.840
I make plans to do things on Sundays, you know!

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.750
Don't invite me out on last minute outings!

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:27.260
So I'll buy you cake. And tea too.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:31.510
It's blazing hot out today! And I'm in a really lousy mood.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:35.030
We'll go to a teahouse with air conditioning.

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.320
Ouch!

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.880
Aha! <b> </b>

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.140
Aha! What?

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:41.690
You have makeup on.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:43.350
I do not!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.780
Yes, you do.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.060
A tiny bit. As a sunblock.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:50.330
What's going on? You're up to something today!

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:55.900
Please! Till 2:30... no, 2:15 is fine. Just stay with me.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:14.730
Yes? Ah, good morning.

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:17.190
What is that sound?

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:20.620
Oooh! Just... cleaning up a bit.

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:23.530
That's unusual. I guess Hell froze over...!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:27.790
Well, when I got up this morning, I felt really good.

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:31.580
Good! Then you can come to practice right? Come on!

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:35.140
You should raise a sweat on a hot day like this!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:38.710
What's that? You can't? You have plans?

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.370
Darn, too bad.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:43.670
"Like raindrops falling into cracks in the ground..."

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:44.550
What?

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:49.420
I found the book you loaned me. It was under the bed.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.000
Oh! Verlaine...

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.030
"Teardrops are falling on my heart."

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:59.230
It doesn't go with today's weather.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.200
It doesn't go with YOU, today, either.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.050
Oh yeah?

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.740
Yeah.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.240
I'll get it back to you on Monday.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.340
Great!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:18.260
So... who are you meeting? and where?

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.350
I can't tell you.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.650
You're so secretive, sheesh!

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.230
Something from the 17th century, I think...

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:14.480
Yes.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.570
Do you think Rei will be there as expected?

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:23.930
I just wanted to tell her that Father was asking about her.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.800
Do you think she is still taking pills?

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:29.860
Who knows.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:36.790
Things are OK now. I think she stopped.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.650
Really?

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:41.790
She is actually a very sincere and happy girl.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.450
I'm surprised.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:48.430
This is the first time I heard you say something good about Rei.

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:53.940
Sorry I bothered you.

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:57.590
I guess I'll go wash my car.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.260
Really? With Saint-Juste-sama?

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:11.000
Geez. You should have said so from the start.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.790
The sunset. I'm going to go see the sunset with her.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:24.070
"You need to lock your door when you're not home!"

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:43.040
Wait a sec... It's a little crooked.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.110
See you later.

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:48.730
Be careful! Your face gives away everything!

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.400
Wham!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.100
May I help you?

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:13.330
Can you make a delivery before the day is out?

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.760
It's OK if it's at night.

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:19.320
Yes. If it's in the city, we can deliver it today.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.840
Then, could I have the bouquet of roses?

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.990
Yes, certainly.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.680
Oh, and this one too.

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:31.320
Of course -- Is that to be delivered as well?

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.880
No. This is for someone I am going to see today.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.960
Thank you very much.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.110
Brother, Dear Brother...

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:58.650
Our rendezvous was a tiny station, far outside the city.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.490
I arrived 15 minutes early, well before evening.

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:06.610
I could see the ocean from there. It was still sparkling.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.380
I just watched the ocean.

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.310
The ocean...

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.580
Rei...!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:36.120
What happened? What's wrong?

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.450
Kaoru-no-Kimi! Are you all right?

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.460
I'm all right, I'm all right. Don't worry!

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.880
That's funny... my shoelaces...

00:22:20.390 --> 00:22:22.660
The sunset is so beautiful...

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:24.380
Yes...

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.530
Miss? Miss Fukiko?

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:52.340
Yes?

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.590
There is a telephone call for you. From the police.

00:22:56.190 --> 00:22:57.720
The police...?

00:22:58.420 --> 00:23:00.990
Hello, Ichinomiya residence.

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:05.130
What!

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:16.270
Fukiko! What's the matter?

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.370
Rei... Rei is dead.

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:38.880
Dear Brother... I waited and waited.

00:23:39.320 --> 00:23:45.050
I waited, knowing that Saint-Juste-sama would be there.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:49.410
I was waiting for her.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
